{"id":"vod_sn_35737","vodId":"35737","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"高达创战者","name_cn":"高达创战者","date":"2013-01-01","year":"2013","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/d5b8027c6641678d979dbb92fd29d112.jpg"},"summary":"动画作品「机动战士高达」的塑料模型通称“钢普拉”在1980年代掀起了一阵狂潮。如今，第2次钢普拉热潮，应该称之为新的浪潮席卷整个世界。受它的人气影响，于是有了“ガンプラバトル”。不是虚拟空间里的CG，而是通过操纵制作好的钢普拉来战斗，使用划时代的系统参加世界大赛。　　故事的主人公入尾成十分钟爱钢普拉，参加钢普拉战斗世界大赛，是这个年轻的钢普拉builder的梦想。作为模型店唯一的一个儿子拥有者超高的钢普拉制作技术的他，却对战斗的操纵十分生疏，以至于在大赛出场的第一战就败北。他遇到了一个叫做雷吉的有着超凡的钢普拉操纵技术的迷般的少年，他们组队像世界大赛发起挑战，目标是参加世界大赛，然后胜利！","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:37:14","playable":true,"episodeCount":25,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/9NZS4Fj0ps1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/UvArPVVu471/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/KLwh012Fex1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/zCHSEmFmdk1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/ySiV3RPgvM1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/2Gpey1Sqab1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/b6bdXQbTyJ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/sEDucF9ecg1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/6s0B6K4Uvx1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/8eK2jLn3GB1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/fi2GK6hzFt1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/8V5erKh7Rp1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/r5vHhThXNR1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/Gcta4QxDwp1/video/index.m3u8"},{"